# Cloudflare Workers static-assets upload ignore file (gitignore-style).
#
# This project's assets.directory is the repo root, and unlike classic
# Cloudflare Pages, Workers static assets has no built-in exclusion for
# dotfiles or source directories — everything not listed here gets uploaded
# and served as a public static file. Confirmed live and publicly reachable
# before this file existed: .git/config, .git/HEAD, .git/logs/HEAD (full
# commit history, reconstructable object-by-object), CLAUDE.md, schema.sql,
# every functions/**/*.js handler's source, and .github/workflows/ci.yml.
#
# No secret *values* were found in git history (everything reads from
# env.* — Cloudflare-managed secrets, never committed), but this still
# needs to stay excluded: git history, D1 schema, and server source have
# no business being public.
.git
.github
functions
CLAUDE.md
schema.sql
